<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26490" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεκ-βάλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pass</i> a needle, string, etc., <i>through, thread,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				98.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.10.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.417
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>subtract from</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῴδια</span>”
				<i>in succession,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					175.35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>pay through a bank</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1200.23
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατόν</span>), <i>march through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Στυμφαλίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.68.5
				</span></i>
			, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pel.</u>
				17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of rivers,
			boundaries, etc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὰ ὅρια εἰς</span>
			. . <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jo.</u>
				15.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Εὐφράτης δ. διὰ τοῦ Ταύρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					16.1.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. εἰς νότον καὶ βορρᾶ&lt;ν&gt;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					2.154.9
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
